-  /// @defgroup cpp_kodi_tools_StringUtils_TimeControl Time value processing
-  /// @ingroup cpp_kodi_tools_StringUtils
-  /// @brief **String time formats**\n
-  /// This is used to process the respective time formats in text fields.
