-
-  //============================================================================
-  /// @brief Converts a time string to the respective integer value.
-  ///
-  /// @param[in] timeString String with time.\n
-  ///                       Following types are possible:
-  ///                       - "MM min" (integer number with "min" on end)
-  ///                       - "HH:MM:SS"
-  /// @return Time in seconds
-  ///
-  ///
-  /// --------------------------------------------------------------------------
